# Lake's build directory: oleans, ileans and dependency caches. Reproducible
# from the sources with `lake build`, and 9 MB of binary evidence does not
# belong in the repository.
.lake/

# Transient files created by check_axioms.sh; its trap removes them, but an
# interrupted run must not be able to stage them.
_axiom_check.lean
_axiom_check.out
